{"id":"word:hebrew:H2620","type":"word","title":"חָסָה","subtitle":"H2620 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"to flee for protection; figuratively, to confide in","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to חָסָה (H2620) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: v.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 37 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"חָסָה (châçâh) means to flee for protection; figuratively, to confide in First listed occurrence: 2Sam 22 3."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"חָסָה","transliteration":"châçâh","pronunciation":"khaw-saw'","strong":"H2620","lemmaId":"hebrew:H2620","partOfSpeech":"v","forms":["חָסִ֑יתִי","לַ/חֲס֥וֹת","הַ/חֹסִ֥ים","חָסִ֥יתִי","אֶחֱסֶה"],"morphs":[["HVqp1cs",8],["HVqi1cs",4],["HTd/Vqrmpa",3],["HVqrmpc",3],["HR/Vqc",3],["HVqp3cp",2],["HRd/Vqrmpa",2],["HVqi3mp",1],["HC/R/Vqc",1],["HC/Td/Vqrmsa",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"to flee for protection; figuratively, to confide in","usage":"have hope, make refuge, (put) trust.","full":"H2620. chasah חָסָה verb (mostly in poetry and figurative) seek refuge (Arabic III. is set aside ; see go aside, apart ; shelter, protection ; but ? = ס ) — Qal Perfect ׳ח Psalm 64:11; 3 feminine singular חָסָ֫יָה Psa 57:2 , חָסִ֫יתִי 7:2 7 t.; plural חָסוּ 37:40 ; Zeph 3:12 , חָסָ֫יוּ Deut 32:37 ; Imperfect יֶחְסֶּה Psa 34:9 , תֶחְסֶּה 91:4 , אֶחְסֶּה 57:2 (see Baer 34:9 ), אֶחֱסֶה 18:3 2 t.; plural יֶחֱסוּ Isa 14:32 , יֶחֱסָיוּן Psa 36:8 ; Imperative חֲסוּ Judg 9:15 ; Infinitive חֲסוֺת Psa 118:8 3 t.; participle חוֺסֶה Isa 57:13 , חֹסֶה Prov 14:32 , חוֺסִים Psa 17:7 3 t.; חֹסְים Prov 30:5 ; 2Sam 22:31 (see Baer Prov 30:5 ), חוֺסֵי Psa 2:12 ; 5:12 , חֹסֵי Nahum 1:7 ; &#8212; seek refuge , with ׃בְּ בְּצֵל in the shadow of a tree Judg 9:15 , מצרים בְּצֵל Isa 30:2 ; בָּהּ 14:32 in Zion, in gods Deut 32:37 (poem), elsewhere in God 2Sam 22:3 = Psa 18:3 ; Nahum 1:7 ; Psa 2:12 ; 5:12 ; 7:2 ; 11:1 ; 16:1 ; 25:20 ; 31:2 ; 31:20 ; 34:9 ; Psalm 34:23; 37:40 ; 57:2 ; Psalm 64:11; 71:1 ; 118:8 ; 118:9 ; 141:8 ; 144:2 , Isa 57:13 ; בו ה)חוסים ל(כל הוא מגן a shield is he to ( all ) who seek refuge in him 2Sam 22:31 = Psa 18:31 ; Prov 30:5 ; ׳בְּ is probably to be supplied in thought at least: חוסים מושׁיע Psa 17:7 saviour of those seeking refuge (in thee); צדיק במותו חסה Prov 14:32 a righteous man in his death seeketh refuge (in Yahweh), י ׳בשׁם Zeph 3:12 , כנפיךָ בצל in the shadow of thy wings Psa 36:8 ; 57:2 ; כנפיךָ בסתר 61:5 , כנפיו תחת under his wings 91:4 = Ruth 2:12 .","rootNote":"a primitive root; (compare 982 )","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"2Sam 22 3","keyReferences":["2Sam 22 3","2Sam 22 31","Deut 32 37","Isa 14 32","Isa 30 2","Isa 57 13","Judg 9 15","Nah 1 7"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":37,"occurrences":[{"reference":"2Sam 22 3","book":"2Sam","chapter":22,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֶחֱסֶה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqi1cs"},{"reference":"2Sam 22 31","book":"2Sam","chapter":22,"verse":31,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/חֹסִ֥ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Vqrmpa"},{"reference":"Deut 32 37","book":"Deut","chapter":32,"verse":37,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חָסָ֥יוּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqp3cp"},{"reference":"Isa 14 32","book":"Isa","chapter":14,"verse":32,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יֶחֱס֖וּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqi3mp"},{"reference":"Isa 30 2","book":"Isa","chapter":30,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/לַ/חְס֖וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/R/Vqc"},{"reference":"Isa 57 13","book":"Isa","chapter":57,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/הַ/חוֹסֶ֥ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Td/Vqrmsa"},{"reference":"Judg 9 15","book":"Judg","chapter":9,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֲס֣וּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqv2mp"},{"reference":"Nah 1 7","book":"Nah","chapter":1,"verse":7,"englishText":""